     2384            reasonm B-14 B-ex back-date B-12 B-13 not-ord B-15 neg-ask B-16
     2385            vat-goods B-17 inv-ship B-18 round-vat-sum B-19 gtd-to-imp-prod B-20
     2386            exc-max-qnty B-22 B-set_attr-PN attr-PN B-23
     2387            B-set_attr-mandatory-gds-in-wayb attr-mandatory-gds-in-wayb B-24
     2388            B-set_attr-mandatory-gds-ret-wayb attr-mandatory-gds-ret-wayb B-25
