     2390            B-set_reasons-write-off B-26
     2391            B-set_attr-mandatory-gds-exp-wayb attr-mandatory-gds-exp-wayb B-21
     2392            edit-fact-wayb v-reasonm v-reasonme reasonme v-back-date v-not-ord
     2393            v-neg-ask v-vat-goods v-inv-ship v-round-vat-sum v-gtd-to-imp-prod
